WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.300
This map represents the real backbone of the world’s economy.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:13.480
This is one of the most important enclaves
on the planet: the strait of HORMUZ.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.770
Maybe this is the first time you’ve heard
of this place.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:20.430
Nevertheless, 1 out of 5 oil barrels bought
across the globe departs from here.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:27.390
Most of the Gulf’s production comes from
this port.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:33.040
As you can see, we have three countries here:
The United Arab Emirates, Oman and… the

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.670
Islamic Republic of IRAN.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:39.739
So this place could become the battlefield
for a war between America and Iran.

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:43.280
And, believe me, this scenario is pretty likely.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:47.370
In fact, the only reason there is no war between
these two countries now is because of a last-minute

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:50.149
decision taken by Donald Trump himself.

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:56.440
By the end of this video, you’ll understand
what’s going on in this very important region.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:06.689
Let’s be clear here: oil is the lifeblood
of Today’s economy.

00:01:06.689 --> 00:01:08.810
Maybe one day this will change.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:15.599
But nowadays, whether we like it or not, we
need dinosaur juice for, virtually, everything.

00:01:15.599 --> 00:01:18.679
And most of this crude is carried on tankers.

00:01:18.679 --> 00:01:25.299
This explains why news like this is so worrisome.

00:01:25.299 --> 00:01:31.650
Oil tanker attacks in the Strait of Hormuz
requires an ‘international response,’

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.859
US envoy to Iran says

00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:38.009
At the time this video was made, 6 oil tankers
have been attacked.

00:01:38.009 --> 00:01:40.310
Somebody put limpet mines on the ship hulls.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.619
Limpet mines are not very powerful explosives.

00:01:42.619 --> 00:01:48.319
But they are destructive enough to make a
hole in the hull so the ship can’t set sail.

00:01:48.319 --> 00:01:49.909
And now you might be wondering…

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:53.099
Who did planted those limpet mines?

00:01:53.099 --> 00:01:54.880
At this moment, nobody knows for sure.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.959
But Donald Trump believes this was Iran’s
doing.

00:01:57.959 --> 00:02:03.270
Think about it, with the nuclear sanctions,
Iran can hardly sell its oil to anybody.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:07.499
This is why, the White House believes, since
they can’t export crude, they decided to

00:02:07.499 --> 00:02:10.149
close the strait of HORMUZ.

00:02:10.149 --> 00:02:14.840
Add to this the fact that America hates Iran.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:17.450
And Saudi Arabia hates Iran even more.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.530
And Saudi Arabia is America’s best friend,
especially under Trump’s administration.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:26.090
So… in other words, Washington doesn’t
need many excuses to attack Teheran.

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:29.370
And Iran is making it even easier for them.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:33.260
In fact, in response to those attacks on the
tankers, America sent a drone to the Iranian

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:34.260
coast.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:37.319
This drone was knocked down by a missile sent
by Iran.

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:39.390
The situation was extremely tense.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:45.540
But it could get even worse.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.609
Just think about it: so far we’re talking
about holes in ships and a knocked down drone

00:02:50.609 --> 00:02:52.400
but… no human losses.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.090
This is where Trump had to make a decision.

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:57.450
Should he answer the attack on the drone or
not?

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:01.090
An airstrike on the region would surely mean
the deaths of Iranian people.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:04.739
And if America killed Iranians, Iran would
want to kill Americans.

00:03:04.739 --> 00:03:09.519
And in that situation, a dead American soldier
would be more than enough for Donald Trump

00:03:09.519 --> 00:03:11.969
to start a war against Iran.

00:03:11.969 --> 00:03:17.049
That’s exactly when EURASIA GROUP, a consultancy,
said that there was a 40% chance that the

00:03:17.049 --> 00:03:18.310
airstrike would start a war.

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:24.889
And then, against the odds, Donald Trump made
a sensible last-minute decision:

00:03:24.889 --> 00:03:31.150
On Monday they shot down an unmanned drone
flying in International Waters.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:36.680
We were cocked &amp; loaded to retaliate last
night on 3 different sights when I asked,

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:37.680
how many will die.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:40.180
150 people, sir, was the answer from a General.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.859
10 minutes before the strike I stopped it.

00:03:42.859 --> 00:03:44.400
--Donad Trump on twitter

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.700
So now the question is…

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:46.700
How did we get here?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.329
Is a war between America and Iran really that
probable?

00:03:50.329 --> 00:03:52.639
How responsible would Donald Trump be for
it?

00:03:52.639 --> 00:03:53.989
And most important of all…

00:03:53.989 --> 00:03:56.129
Who is attacking these tankers?

00:03:56.129 --> 00:03:59.400
Today we are going to answer all of these
questions but, before we do, let’s take

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:06.549
a look back at the history.

00:04:06.549 --> 00:04:08.260
UNINTENDED CONSEQUENCES

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:12.390
On VisualPolitik, we have a series of videos
devoted to Iran sanctions.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.889
If you want to understand all of this in depth,
you should check it out.

00:04:15.889 --> 00:04:19.069
But I’ll make a quick summary for everyone
new to the channel.

00:04:19.069 --> 00:04:24.430
For years, Iran was isolated from international
trade as a punishment for its nuclear program.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.590
In the year 2015, Obama made a deal with Teheran.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:32.240
Basically, the United States would lift most
of the trade embargo in exchange for Iran

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:34.639
stopping its manufacturing of nukes.

00:04:34.639 --> 00:04:39.240
All of a sudden, Iran could restart its oil
exports.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:45.320
But a year later, Trump came to office.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.940
One of his first policies was to break that
nuclear deal with Iran.

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:53.460
According to him, Iran never stopped its nuclear
program despite what anybody said.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:57.340
So, from one day to the next, America went
back to the embargo.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.889
But Trump didn’t stop here!

00:04:58.889 --> 00:05:04.230
His goal was to make the ENTIRE WORLD stop
trading with Iran, not only American companies.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.980
This is where one debate started…

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:10.539
Why would a European company obey what Washington
said?

00:05:10.539 --> 00:05:13.720
Well… months later, we can say that Trump
won that fight.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.800
Most of the world has stopped investmenting
in Iran.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.410
This includes Renault factories and French
oil rigs.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:26.800
As you can imagine, this has had terrible
consequences for Iran’s economy.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:31.720
Iran's Latest Inflation Figure Tops 50 Percent
- Food Prices Jump 85 Percent

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.690
Yes, you heard that right.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:38.060
Despite Iran having the World’s fourth largest
oil reserves, nobody dares to buy from them.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.720
So the country is on the edge of collapse.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:43.129
And on top of that are all of the protests
against the government.

00:05:43.129 --> 00:05:48.710
At this point, I know what many of you might
be thinking: is this the end of the Ayatollah

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:49.710
regime?

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:51.670
In fact, the opposite is true.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.880
What is happening is what we predicted months
ago here, at VisualPolitik.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:58.669
By the way… this is a good moment to remind
you that we publish brand new videos every

00:05:58.669 --> 00:06:02.569
week, so you should subscribe to this channel
aaaaand hit that bell button!

00:06:02.569 --> 00:06:07.099
When you hit the bell button, you receive
a notification any time we post a new video

00:06:07.099 --> 00:06:10.720
so you don’t miss it and you’re always
up to date with the best understanding of

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.169
the World’s politics.

00:06:12.169 --> 00:06:17.860
So, as we said on that video months ago, in
Iranian politics, there are three main factions:

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.789
reformists, moderates and radicals.

00:06:19.789 --> 00:06:23.190
Iran’s current president, HASSAN ROUHANI
is a moderate.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:31.970
This is why he was willing to reach that nuclear
deal with America.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:36.330
But after the conversations failed, his political
capital fell to its lowest point.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.129
And who wins in this scenario?

00:06:38.129 --> 00:06:39.129
Exactly!

00:06:39.129 --> 00:06:40.379
The radicals.

00:06:40.379 --> 00:06:44.659
Those who wanted to keep the nuclear program
at any cost and never wanted to talk with

00:06:44.659 --> 00:06:45.659
the White House.

00:06:45.659 --> 00:06:51.490
So, among these radicals, we have a very important
group, the ISLAMIC REVOLUTIONARY GUARD.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:56.669
The Islamic Revolutionary Guard is an elite
group created in order to maintain the values

00:06:56.669 --> 00:06:57.889
of the Ayatollah revolution.

00:06:57.889 --> 00:07:01.580
They have state of the art weapons and world-class
training.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:07.260
And, believe me, they have never been as powerful
as they are now.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:14.539
Iran’s Elite Defense Force Finds New Funding
Sources as Tension Rises With U.S.

00:07:14.539 --> 00:07:19.400
As you know, Iran plays its role as a regional
power and it participates in foreign Wars.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:24.550
The group that trains the pro-Iranian warriors
in countries like Siria, Lebanon and Yemen

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.449
is this Revolutionary Guard.

00:07:26.449 --> 00:07:30.020
In recent years, the troops trained by them
have increased by 20%.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:34.310
For example, Hezbollah or the Houthi rebels
are so deadly because of this training.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:37.460
And how does the Revolutionary Guard get its
funding?

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:40.410
With state monopolies.

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:45.400
A good share of Iran’s economy is in their
hands.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.350
For example, the Iranian telecom company is
owned by them.

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:52.389
And in the past few years, many other businesses
are falling under their control.

00:07:52.389 --> 00:07:55.110
Here’s another example: TOTAL is a French
oil company.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.590
With the Trump sanctions, they had to abandon
all of their oil rigs.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:02.389
So guess who’s taking them now?

00:08:02.389 --> 00:08:04.490
Exactly!

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:08.729
REVOLUTIONARY GUARDS DRILL INTO IRAN'S GAS
POTENTIAL

00:08:08.729 --> 00:08:11.139
In other words, Iran’s economy is like a
cake.

00:08:11.139 --> 00:08:13.020
Now the cake is getting smaller and smaller.

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:16.520
But the Revolutionary Guard is having a bigger
and bigger share of it.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:20.710
At this moment, we can say they are more powerful
than the president himself.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:26.080
And this explains news like this.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:29.590
Iran nuclear deal: Enriched uranium limit
will be breached on 27 June

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:33.250
In other words: officially, Iran is restarting
its nuclear program.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:37.730
If Trump thought that sanctions would push
the Ayatollah into the corner… his plan

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:38.730
has just backfired.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.420
But wait a minute now!

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:45.950
If you thought the situation couldn’t get
any worse… pay attention to this next chapter.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:51.030
THE FORGOTTEN WAR

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:54.570
War in Yemen has sort of become the Arab Vietnam.

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:57.310
Yemen is the only poor country in the Arabian
peninsula.

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:02.490
And this is the battlefield on which the Saudis
and the Iranians fight their proxy war.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:04.660
Initially, this was meant to be a quick war.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:09.191
At the end of the day, Saudi Arabia has the
third most expensive army on the planet, with

00:09:09.191 --> 00:09:13.960
top-notch weaponry, American support and tons
of money.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:20.030
But, as we explained in this video, Money
can buy good weapons but not a good strategy.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:25.160
This is why those Houthi rebels are causing
such a big headache for the Saudis.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:30.020
And… this is a hell of a problem!

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:33.490
Despite losing the war, the Saudis have enough
money to keep fighting without surrendering.

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:39.090
As long as America and the UK keep sending
weapons, Saudi Arabia will keep bombing.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.880
And as long as Iran keeps supporting the Houthis,
the war in Yemen won’t budge.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:47.470
Nowadays, the violence in this region is so
insane that it’s reached beyond Yemeni borders.

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:51.170
Yemen's Houthi rebels strike Saudi airport

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:57.030
This year, in 2019, the Houthi rebels attacked
a power plant and an oil pipe in Saudi territory.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:02.310
But if you thought that was bad enough, here’s
news that has shaken the World’s economic

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.980
backbone.

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:08.290
Two oil tankers attacked in Gulf of Oman

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:11.330
At the time this video was made, 6 oil tankers
have been attacked.

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.740
Who orchestrated these attacks?

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.160
We still don’t know.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.870
America thinks Iran is behind this.

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:18.930
And… it seems reasonable that Houthi rebels
did this.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:23.180
These rebels have Iranian training but they
might be acting on their own behalf.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.310
Not only that!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:29.280
Remember that the ones who are training this
group are the Islamic Revolutionary Guard.

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:33.020
And those boys don’t need Teheran permission
to do anything.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.630
In other words: perhaps Rouhani doesn’t
want to attack oil tankers.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:42.910
But even if it was him… he might not be
able to control the Houthi rebels.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:47.370
Anyway, this is just speculation.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:52.030
The truth is, at the time we made this video,
nobody has claimed responsibility for these

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.030
attacks.

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:55.480
Meanwhile, America has sent 1500 troops to
the area.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.560
This means that, so far, Uncle Sam can secure
the Strait of Hormuz.

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:00.550
But there are still big risks.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:05.050
You see, no matter how much military presence
you have, there can always be somebody putting

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.540
a mine on one of those tankers.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.380
OK, this doesn’t have to be a big attack.

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:09.380
Nobody dies.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:13.900
But this mine is big enough to blast a hole
in the hull and stop the tanker from sailing.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.730
What does this all mean?

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.690
That the companies that insure those tankers
might raise their premiums.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:23.210
And this would have a direct effect on oil
prices worldwide.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:28.260
All of this means that, whatever military
presence they send, America needs a diplomatic

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:29.260
solution.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.260
But…

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:31.260
Iranians don’t trust Donald Trump anymore!

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:34.120
After all, he is the one who broke a previously
signed deal.

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:35.910
So who can do this job?

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:41.200
Let’s have a look, shall we?

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.700
OUR MAN IN TOKYO

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.950
Do you remember Shinzo Abe, the Japanese prime
minister?

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:49.230
Anytime we talk about him on VisualPolitik
it’s because we’re talking about economics,

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.760
a crisis, or the Olympic games.

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:52.760
The truth is…

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:55.310
Japan has never been big on diplomacy… til
now.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:12:00.550
In June 2019, Shinzo Abe travelled to Tehran
to hold negotiations on behalf of Donald Trump.

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:01.740
At the end of the day…

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:02.860
Who wouldn’t trust the Japanese?

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:03.860
Huh?

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:04.860
Just… look at his eyes!

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:05.860
Wouldn’t you have a beer with him?

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:08.570
Wouldn’t you add him on Facebook if he sent
you a friend request?

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:10.500
It’s uncle Shinzo, your cool Japanese friend!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.130
So… did this plan work?

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:17.200
Well… the answer is a clear NO.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:23.570
Two Japan-Bound Tankers Reportedly Attacked
Near Strait of Hormuz

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:27.290
That’s what I call not receiving somebody
with open arms…

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:32.310
So, in conclusion, Shinzo Abe returned home
really sad and Donad Trump started to do his

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.310
thing.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:36.490
After the attack on those tankers, America
sent a drone to spy on the Iranian coast.

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.090
And what do you think happened?

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.430
Well, I told you before!

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:42.290
The Iranian army knocked it down.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.511
And right at this moment, the tension was
higher than ever.

00:12:44.511 --> 00:12:49.870
At this very moment, the consultancy, EURASIA
GROUP, raised the chance of war from 30% to

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.870
40%.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.690
And it could get even worse.

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:56.930
What could Donald Trump have done after his
drone had been knocked down?

00:12:56.930 --> 00:13:01.810
On one hand, he could make an air strike.

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:04.860
But this would probably end with the loss
of human lives.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:09.040
And if, then, Iran answered with another air
strike, some American soldiers might have

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.040
died.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:13.980
And, my dear viewers, if an American died
during this conflict… Trump would be almost

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:19.500
forced to start a war.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.500
And now you might be wondering…

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.190
Does America really want a war here?

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.890
It would make no sense whatsoever.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:29.740
First of all, as we’ve seen, Iran has a
really big and well trained army.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.250
We’re talking about a country of 80M people.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.430
This is twice as much as the population of
Iraq.

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:36.430
But not only that!

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.310
Do you really think anybody wants to have
a war at the Strait of Hormuz?

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:44.300
In this case, America and the rest of the
World has much more to lose than Iran.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.240
At the end of the day, Iran cannot export
most of their oil.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:55.300
And nobody wants such a big spike in the oil
market price.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.100
So now the questions go to all of you…

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:02.050
Do you think that, despite everything, we’ll
end up witnessing a war between America and

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:03.050
Iran?

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:05.650
Do you think the Iran nuclear sanctions were
a good idea?

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.190
How would you solve this problem?

